  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Ms. Thompson's class noticed something sad — the butterflies that used to fill the school garden every spring weren't coming anymore.",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "durationSeconds": 8.1
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Where did they go?\" asked Priya.",
      "startSeconds": 8.4,
      "durationSeconds": 2.525
    },
    {
      "text": "The class learned that the wildflowers butterflies need had been replaced by plain grass.",
      "startSeconds": 11.225,
      "durationSeconds": 5.625
    },
    {
      "text": "\"But there's good news,\" said Ms. Thompson.",
      "startSeconds": 17.55,
      "durationSeconds": 2.975
    },
    {
      "text": "She showed them photos of a school in Texas that planted a butterfly garden and now has hundreds of butterflies every year.",
      "startSeconds": 20.825,
      "durationSeconds": 8.65
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Nature can bounce back when we help.\"",
      "startSeconds": 29.775,
      "durationSeconds": 2.55
    },
    {
      "text": "The class drew up a garden plan.",
      "startSeconds": 33.025,
      "durationSeconds": 2.525
    },
    {
      "text": "They picked flowers that butterflies love — milkweed, zinnias, and lavender.",
      "startSeconds": 35.85,
      "durationSeconds": 5.15
    },
    {
      "text": "They measured the garden space and made a shopping list.",
      "startSeconds": 41.3,
      "durationSeconds": 3.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Each student picked one plant to be responsible for.",
      "startSeconds": 45.05,
      "durationSeconds": 3.725
    },
    {
      "text": "By May, the garden was blooming.",
      "startSeconds": 49.475,
      "durationSeconds": 2.575
    },
    {
      "text": "The first monarch butterfly arrived on a Tuesday morning, and the whole class ran to the window to watch.",
      "startSeconds": 52.35,
      "durationSeconds": 6.75
    },
    {
      "text": "By June, they counted 47 butterflies in one afternoon.",
      "startSeconds": 59.4,
      "durationSeconds": 4.675
    }
  ],
